       mounts", SD47; the owner's card of 26 Nov 2026). Its standalone guns, set on our gun ring by role: the M1919, PKM and MG3 on every
       truck with a ring, the M2HB, DShK and Mk 19 on the Talus and the Kelly; either/or with our own guns, worked by the ring's gunner.
